#: addons/bbcs-forced-inclusions/views/settings.php:55
msgid "A single file in wp-content that replaces one built-in part of WordPress."
msgstr "קובץ יחיד בתיקיית wp-content שמחליף חלק מובנה אחד של וורדפרס."

#: addons/bbcs-forced-inclusions/views/settings.php:133
msgid "a single file with a name WordPress recognises, such as object-cache.php. It replaces one built-in part of WordPress, for example caching or the \"site is down for maintenance\" page."
